          "text": "<p>Consider the following languages. Which of them are context-free?</p><p>$$<br>L_1:\\left\\{w \\in\\{a, b\\}^* \\mid\\right.<br>$$</p><p>$w$ contains a string of the form $a^n b^n$ as a subsequence, for some $\\left.n \\geq 1\\right\\}$</p><p>$$<br>L_2:\\left\\{w \\in\\{0,1\\}^* \\mid\\right.<br>$$</p><p>$w$ is a palindrome and, when interpreted as a binary number, its value is a multiple of 3 \\}<br>$L_3:\\left\\{w \\# w \\mid w \\in\\{a, b\\}^*\\right.$ and the number of $a$ 's in $w$ equals the number of $b$ 's in $\\left.w\\right\\}$</p><ol start=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type: upper-alpha;\"><li>$L_1$ and $L_3$ only<br>&nbsp;</li><li>$L_2$ only<br>&nbsp;</li><li>$L_3$ only<br>&nbsp;</li><li>$L_1$ and $L_2$ only</li></ol>",
